2. Test fixtures. Files under pipelines/tests/**/fixtures/ are verbatim
   upstream responses or excerpts of them, included only to test the
   parsers. Text fixtures start with a header giving the source URL and
   capture date; binary ones are described in a .source.txt file beside them
   or in the test helper that loads them. They keep their sources' terms.
   Most are U.S. Government works in the public domain. Others include:
   - CC BY 4.0: GCAT (planet4589.org), the World Bank WDI, Ember, and the
